  MIT            everything not listed below: the host software, the vendored
                 spectrum viewer, the MT7981 firmware tooling, the register and
                 recipe documentation, and the build and install scripts
  ISC            files that derive from MediaTek's mt76 driver
                 (kernel/mt7915-icap/), which keep MediaTek's copyright

The spectrum viewer under host/spectrum/ and the stream header
host/stream/include/w1700k_stream.h are vendored from W1700K-SDR, MIT,
Copyright (c) 2026 h0m3us3r; their SPDX headers and copyright are kept
verbatim and are not relicensed. Modifications made for this project are
marked in-file.

MediaTek's Wi-Fi firmware is proprietary and is NOT redistributed in this
repository. The firmware/ tooling patches a copy of the firmware that the
running OpenWrt system already carries; no MediaTek binary or source is
committed here (see .gitignore). The MT7981 firmware code added by this
project is built locally from source and contains no MediaTek code.

